sequenceDiagram
    participant CLI as CLI Tool Binary
    participant Svc as CLI Manager Service
    participant Reg as Registry Manager
    participant DB as Tool Metadata DB

    CLI->>Svc: 注册请求 (tool_name, desc_path)
    Svc->>Reg: 解析描述文件
    Reg->>DB: 验证工具唯一性
    DB-->>Reg: 返回验证结果
    Reg->>DB: 存储工具元数据
    DB-->>Svc: 注册成功
    Svc-->>CLI: 返回注册结果